    "_comment": "PILOT (not a preregistered arm). Identical to adversarial_mm_cluster_config1.json except inv_penalty. The v2 sweep ran inv_penalty='none' in every arm, which mm_env.py turns into inv_pen = 0.0, so nothing in the reward pushed inventory back toward flat: reward_mm decayed from about -2.5 to -34 across each 6400s episode and 12 of 20 baseline seeds ended at quote_presence 0 exactly. inv_penalty_quadratic_factor F is anchored on the A-S benchmark, the one policy that passes the progression gate: it holds inventory_sd 8.17 and peak 26, so at F=250 the penalty is 0.26 at inventory 8 and 2.70 at 26 (negligible over the range A-S actually occupies) while reaching 25.0 at the learned MM's observed sd of 79 and 305 at its peak of 276. The penalty is meant to bite where the ratchet lives and nowhere else. inv_penalty_quadratic_factor is set EXPLICITLY because omitting it does not fail loudly: jaxob_config.py declares it with a default of 50.0, so a config that selects 'quadratic' and says nothing else silently gets a penalty 20x stronger than this one - 13.5 at inventory 26, where A-S normally sits.",
